- `https://docs.qoder.com/events/qoduck-free` — 200, the vendor's own promotion page: stealth identity undisclosed, promo window 2026-11-07 → 2026-11-11 10:00 (UTC+8), 0.5x → 0.0x credit rate, individual plans only, "Qoduck will be removed when the promotion ends".
- `https://x.com/alibaba_cloud/status/2118992047613080032` — Alibaba Cloud's announcement: "A stealth model just landed in Qoder: Qoduck. Don't ask where it came from. Free every day for all individual users, for a limited time."
